\s1 Intermarriage with Neighboring Peoples
\r (Nehemiah 13:23–31)
\p \v 1 \w After these things|strong="H00428"\w* \w had been accomplished|strong="H03615"\w*, \w the leaders|strong="H08269"\w* \w approached|strong="H05066"\w* \w me|strong="H00413"\w* \w and said|strong="H00559"\w*, “\w The people|strong="H05971"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H03478"\w*, \w including the priests|strong="H03548"\w* \w and Levites|strong="H03881"\w*, \w have not|strong="H03808"\w* \w kept themselves separate|strong="H00914"\w* \w from the surrounding|strong="H00776"\w* \w peoples|strong="H05971"\w* \w whose abominations|strong="H08441"\w* \w are like those of the Canaanites|strong="H03669"\w*, \w Hittites|strong="H02850"\w*, \w Perizzites|strong="H06522"\w*, \w Jebusites|strong="H02983"\w*, \w Ammonites|strong="H05984"\w*, \w Moabites|strong="H04125"\w*, \w Egyptians|strong="H04713"\w*, \w and Amorites|strong="H00567"\w*. \v 2 \w Indeed|strong="H03588"\w*, \w the Israelites have taken|strong="H05375"\w* \w some of their daughters [as wives]|strong="H01323"\w* for themselves \w and their sons|strong="H01121"\w*, \w so that the holy|strong="H06944"\w* \w seed|strong="H02233"\w* \w has been mixed|strong="H06148"\w* \w with the people|strong="H05971"\w* \w of the land|strong="H00776"\w*. \w And the leaders|strong="H08269"\w* \w and officials|strong="H05461"\w* \w have taken the lead|strong="H03027"\w* \w . . .|strong="H01961"\w* \w . . .|strong="H07223"\w* \w in this|strong="H02088"\w* \w unfaithfulness|strong="H04604"\w*!”
\p \v 3 \w When I heard|strong="H08085"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w this|strong="H02088"\w* \w report|strong="H01697"\w*, \w I tore|strong="H07167"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w my tunic|strong="H00899"\w* \w and cloak|strong="H04598"\w*, \w pulled out|strong="H04803"\w* \w some hair|strong="H08181"\w* \w from my head|strong="H07218"\w* \w and beard|strong="H02206"\w*, \w and sat down|strong="H03427"\w* \w in horror|strong="H08074"\w*.
